  "title": "Sweet Smoked Pork Ribs",
  "description": "This smoked ribs recipe cooks baby back pork ribs coated with a spicy rub, and basted with a sweet BBQ sauce until tender in a smoker.",
  "authors": [
    "dadcooksagain"
  ],
  "date_published": "2020-06-18T23:37:06-04:00",
